      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117302022295128863</guid>
      <link>https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117302022295128863</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 06:46:54 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Games are still amazing these days, but I feel many of the higher productions ones are starting to have their “100 camera cuts to show an action scene” movies moment. Let it breathe. That’s what I think also helped the cozy-relaxed genre flourish.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
